    "description": "Steam in the catalog: the note on its status, under the status chip on its page and on its card in the add-app dialog. The same text as its statusNote in the engine's catalog_data.dart."
  },
  "catalogSteamNote1": "The first start downloads the 64-bit client (about 235 MB) and unpacks it: under Rosetta it takes 15-25 min and may look frozen. If it closes, open it again: it carries on.",
  "@catalogSteamNote1": {
    "description": "Steam in the catalog: note 1 of the Notes section of its page, also shown in the install panel once it is installed. The same text as its notes[0] in the engine's catalog_data.dart."
