    "description": "Steam in the catalog: note 2 of the Notes section of its page, also shown in the install panel once it is installed. The same text as its notes[1] in the engine's catalog_data.dart. Settings > Interface > … is Steam's own menu path: use the words Steam shows in the target language."
  },
  "catalogSteamNote3": "This bottle runs without msync because the Steam window hangs with it. Highball reports that games perform about 40% better with msync.",
  "@catalogSteamNote3": {
    "description": "Steam in the catalog: note 3 of the Notes section of its page, also shown in the install panel once it is installed. The same text as its notes[2] in the engine's catalog_data.dart."
